###Block: Descriptions
Arcane Fusion.MOD	DESC:Cast two spells you know without expending additional slots.
Arcane Fusion (Greater).MOD	DESC:Cast two spells without expending additional slots.
Arcane Turmoil.MOD	DESC:Targeted dispel magic on one subject, and subject loses one spell.
Aspect of the Icy Hunter.MOD	DESC:You take the form of a winter wolf.
Attentive Alarm.MOD	DESC:As alarm, plus learn type and number of creatures that triggered alarm.
Battlecry.MOD	DESC:Gain bonus on attacks and saves, bardic music effects extended.
Blackrot.MOD	DESC:Deal damage to plant creatures, or use wooden weapons to sicken foes.
Bloodletting.MOD	DESC:Your light weapon creates a bleeding wound that deals an extra 1d6 damage per round.
Boiling Blood.MOD	DESC:Deal 2d6 fire damage per round, second casting sickens target.
Bothersome Babble.MOD	DESC:Subject's speech becomes incoherent; second casting makes speech painful.
Cacophonous Alarm.MOD	DESC:First creature to trigger alarm affected by sound burst spell.
Caterwaul.MOD	DESC:Horrible wail renders creatures nauseated or sickened for 1 round.
Catsfeet.MOD	DESC:Reroll a Balance, Climb, Jump, or Move Silently check with a +5 bonus.
Caustic Mire.MOD	DESC:Acidic sludge slows progress, deals damage.
Caustic Smoke.MOD	DESC:Cloud deals 1d6 acid damage/round, blinds creatures.
Channeled Lifetheft.MOD	DESC:Fatigue, exhaust, and deal damage to target, depending on casting time.
Channeled Sonic Blast.MOD	DESC:Deal sonic damage in cone; area and damage increase based on casting time.
Choking Cobwebs.MOD	DESC:Cobwebs provide concealment, slow movement, sicken creatures.
Climbing Tree.MOD	DESC:Temporarily grow a tall tree for use as a ladder.
Coat of Arms.MOD	DESC:Surround yourself with blades of force.
Combined Talent.MOD	DESC:Allows one subject to use the skill ranks of a second subject in place of her own.
Critical Strike (CM).MOD	DESC:Ignore miss chance from concealment, deliver sneak attack against foe with concealment.
Cryptwarden's Grasp.MOD	DESC:Bestow mummy rot with your touch.
Crystalline Memories.MOD	DESC:Read subject's surface thoughts, deal hit point and Int damage.
Deadly Lahar.MOD	DESC:Create a wave of molten volcanic rock that sticks to creatures.
Deadly Sunstroke.MOD	DESC:Creatures take (CASTERLEVEL)d6 damage and become fatigued.
Deafening Blast.MOD	DESC:Permanently deafen all targets in 20-foot-radius spread.
Death's Call.MOD	DESC:Scream deals (CASTERLEVEL) points of damage (more to swarms), fatigues all within 10 feet.
Deathsight.MOD	DESC:Make death attack without spending rounds in observation.
Deceptive Facade.MOD	DESC:Disguise appearance of another creature or object.
Dimension Jumper.MOD	DESC:Teleport yourself up to 30 feet once per round.
Dimension Jumper (Greater).MOD	DESC:Teleport yourself up to 60 feet once per round.
Discordant Malediction.MOD	DESC:Subject takes sonic damage each time she casts a spell with a verbal component.
Doublespeak.MOD	DESC:Subject's speech is masked from listeners.
Dreaded Form of the Eye Tyrant.MOD	DESC:You take the form of a beholder.
Elemental Eye.MOD	DESC:See through a designated object.
Endless Slumber.MOD	DESC:Subject falls asleep and is not easily roused.
Enduring Scrutiny.MOD	DESC:Become aware when target performs designated action.
Energy Absorption.MOD	DESC:Target gains resistance 10 to energy, can turn one energy attack into healing.
Escalating Enfeeblement.MOD	DESC:As ray of enfeeblement, but greater effect against already weakened target.
False Lie.MOD	DESC:Subject seems to be lying, both to Sense Motive and divinations, even when she is not.
Familiar Refuge.MOD	DESC:Safely teleport self to familiar or familiar to self as a swift action.
Fever Dream.MOD	DESC:Illusory vision fatigues or exhausts target, makes spellcasting difficult.
Finger of Agony.MOD	DESC:Deals 3d6 damage per round and nauseates or sickens target.
Fire and Brimstone.MOD	DESC:Subject takes fire damage, might be sickened.
Flaying Tendrils.MOD	DESC:You grow mind flayer tentacles, which you can use to attack your foes.
Form of the Threefold Beast.MOD	DESC:You take on the form of a chimera.
Genius Loci.MOD	DESC:Create a guardian spirit for a specific location.
Ghost Lantern.MOD	DESC:Generate light that only you and companions can see.
Great Worm of the Earth.MOD	DESC:Enormous wormlike maw attempts to swallow target.
Guided Path.MOD	DESC:Find nearest establishment of the designated type.
Heart of Air.MOD	DESC:Gain +10 on Jump checks, +10 ft. to fly speed, feather fall once.
Heart of Earth.MOD	DESC:Gain temporary hit points; +8 to resist bull rush, overrun, and trip; use stoneskin once.
Heart of Fire.MOD	DESC:Gain +10 ft. to land speed, resistance to fire 10, use fire shield once.
Heart of Water.MOD	DESC:Gain swim speed, ability to breathe water, +5 on Escape Artist checks, freedom of movement once.
Hood of the Cobra.MOD	DESC:You appear serpentine to target, and can deliver illusory poison bites.
Horrid Sickness.MOD	DESC:Subjects are nauseated or Sickened.
Immediate Assistance.MOD	DESC:Allow subject to reroll a skill check.
Incendiary Slime.MOD	DESC:Create slippery substance like grease, but highly flammable.
Incendiary Surge.MOD	DESC:Cone of fire deals (CASTERLEVEL)d6 damage, (CASTERLEVEL)d8 damage on consecutive casting.
Interminable Echo.MOD	DESC:Illusory sound applies -10 penalty on Listen checks, deals 2d6 damage each round.
Karmic Backlash.MOD	DESC:Any creature damaging you becomes exhausted for 2 rounds.
Karmic Retribution.MOD	DESC:Any creature damaging you becomes stunned for 1 round.
Lash of Force.MOD	DESC:Whip of force strikes for (CASTERLEVEL*5)d6; can become a 15d6 line attack.
Lightning Leap.MOD	DESC:Transform into bolt of lightning, damaging foes and transporting yourself.
Lingering Chorus.MOD	DESC:Magic voices maintain your bardic music.
Lingering Flames.MOD	DESC:Eruption of fire deals (CASTERLEVEL)d6 damage each round for 3 rounds.
Luminous Swarm.MOD	DESC:Target takes 1d6 damage/round, has 20%% miss chance on attacks.
Magic Savant.MOD	DESC:Gain +4 bonus on Use Magic Device, take 10 on check if you have 10 ranks.
Mask of the Ideal.MOD	DESC:Gain +4 bonus on skill checks, checks to influence enchanted or conjured creatures.
Slumber Arrows.MOD	DESC:Your arrows cause the subject to fall asleep for 1 hour.
Mage's Trusted Bloodhound.MOD	DESC:Create a ferocious hound that tracks and attacks foes.
Mysterious Redirection.MOD	DESC:Attacks against you have 50%% chance to strike adjacent target instead.
Near Horizon.MOD	DESC:Remove increment-based penalties on ranged attacks.
Necrotic Curse.MOD	DESC:Cure spells in area deal damage, living beings don't heal with rest.
Nightmare Terrain.MOD	DESC:Create a patch of illusory terrain that hinders foes and allows you to hide.
Suppressing Field.MOD	DESC:Spells of a designated school or subtype are suppressed.
Imperative Ambulation.MOD	DESC:Subject must move at least 10 feet each round.
Painful Echoes.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d4 sonic damage per round and sicken targets.
Pall of Twilight.MOD	DESC:Veil of shadow impedes sight and sound.
Phantasmal Strangler.MOD	DESC:Nightmare grapples and strangles one foe.
Prickling Torment.MOD	DESC:Target is sickened, takes damage whenever it acts.
Prismatic Aura.MOD	DESC:Shield of colors offers concealment and damages your attackers.
Prismatic Bow.MOD	DESC:Creates bow that allows seven attacks, each with a diferent prismatic effect.
Prismatic Deluge.MOD	DESC:Call down a prismatic effect over a wide area.
Rain of Spines.MOD	DESC:Spines rain down on area, dealing 6d6 damage and pinning creatures to ground.
Arcane Conversion.MOD	DESC:Instantly lose a prepared wizard spell and replace it with another spell from your spellbook.
Reaving Aura.MOD	DESC:All creatures below 0 hit points within 10 feet of you take 1 point of damage.
Rebirth of Iron.MOD	DESC:Completely restores any metal item destroyed by rust, even if reduced to powder.
Repelling Shield.MOD	DESC:Invisible disc gives +4 to AC, blocks magic missiles, pushes away attackers.
Resinous Tar.MOD	DESC:Sticky substance slows movement or renders object difficult to drop.
Resonating Agony.MOD	DESC:Subject nauseated or sickened for (CASTERLEVEL) rounds.
Resounding Thunder.MOD	DESC:Lasting sound deals 4d6 sonic damage per round, deafens creatures within area.
Retributive Enervation.MOD	DESC:Any living creature that strikes you in melee combat gains a negative level.
Retributive Image.MOD	DESC:Created illusion deals damage to those who disbelieve it.
Rusted Blade.MOD	DESC:Touched weapon delivers filth fever.
Seed of Undeath.MOD	DESC:Subject that dies before spell expires rises as a zombie under your command.
Seed of Undeath (Greater).MOD	DESC:As seed of undeath, but affects an area.
Shape of the Hellspawned Stalker.MOD	DESC:You take the form of a hell hound.
Smoky Confinement.MOD	DESC:Subject is imprisoned within a Tiny receptacle.
Spellcaster's Bane.MOD	DESC:Gain +2 on dispel, counterspell checks, recognize cast spell and caster level.
Steal Summoning.MOD	DESC:Take control of another caster's summoned monster.
Storm of Fire and Ice.MOD	DESC:Storm provides concealment, slows movement, deals cold and fire damage.
Storm of Needles.MOD	DESC:A deluge of needles deals (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d4 damage in 30-ft. cone.
Summon Component.MOD	DESC:Create a noncostly spell component.
Summon Weapon.MOD	DESC:Create normal, nonmagical light weapon.
Tactical Teleportation.MOD	DESC:Teleport (CASTERLEVEL/3) creatures a short distance.
Tenacious Dispelling.MOD	DESC:As targeted dispel magic, but second consecutive casting is more potent.
Torrent of Tears.MOD	DESC:Subject is temporarily blinded and emotionally distraught.
Touch of the Graveborn.MOD	DESC:Melee touch attack deals 10d6 damage or controls undead creature.
Touch of Vecna.MOD	DESC:Deal negative energy damage and paralysis with your touch.
Touch of Years.MOD	DESC:Target loses 3 points of Str, Dex, and Con, second casting blinds and deafens.
Towering Thunderhead.MOD	DESC:Clouds provide concealment, block ranged attacks, empower sonic or electricity spells.
Toxic Tongue.MOD	DESC:Gnerate small amount of poison that you can spit or place on a weapon.
Transcend Mortality.MOD	DESC:You are nigh-unkillable for a brief period, but die immediately afterward.
True Casting.MOD	DESC:+10 on your next spell penetration roll.
Unicorn Blood.MOD	DESC:Gain immunity to poison, compulsion, charm effects, bestow temporary hp once.
Unicorn Heart.MOD	DESC:Gain speed of 60 ft, +4 on Str, Dex, and Con based checks, use dimension door once.
Unicorn Horn.MOD	DESC:You grow a horn that functions as a natural weapon.
Unseen Strike.MOD	DESC:Invisibility effect triggered to activate the instant you successfully attack someone.
Unyielding Form of Inevitable Death.MOD	DESC:You take the form of a marut.
Malevolent Whisper.MOD	DESC:Reduces living creatures with 10 hp or lower to -9 hp.
Vigilant Slumber.MOD	DESC:Set specific conditions under which you immediately wake up.
Vital Strike.MOD	DESC:Your next attack deals sneak attack damage.
All-Seeing Eyes.MOD	DESC:As comprehend languages on written material, bonus on Search and Spot checks.
Baneful Blast.MOD	DESC:Eldritch blast deals extra 2d6 damage against specified creature type.
Binding Blast.MOD	DESC:Target of your eldritch blast must make Will save or be stunned for 1 round.
Call of the Beast.MOD	DESC:Speak with animals and influence their behaviour as a Druid of your level.
Caster's Lament.MOD	DESC:Your touch can break enchantment, and you can counterspell.
Caustic Mire (Invocation).MOD	DESC:Acidic sludge slows progress, deals damage.
Cold Comfort.MOD	DESC:You and nearby allies protected by endure elements.
Crawling Eye.MOD	DESC:Your eye leaves your head and grows spidery legs, enabling it to scout for you.
Disembodied Hand.MOD	DESC:Detach one of your hands and send it forth to manipulate objects or attack.
Hammer Blast.MOD	DESC:Eldritch blast deals normal damage to objects.
Hellspawned Grace.MOD	DESC:Transform into a hellcat for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Hindering Blast.MOD	DESC:Target of your eldritch blast must succeed on a Will save or be slowed for 1 round.
Mask of Flesh.MOD	DESC:Touch attack imposes 1d6 Cha penalty and transforms you to look like target.
Nightmares Made Real.MOD	DESC:Create illusory terrain that damages foes and allows you to hid.
Otherworldly Whispers.MOD	DESC:Gain bonus on Knowledge checks.
Painful Slumber of Ages.MOD	DESC:Creature falls asleep, takes damage when awakened.
Relentless Dispelling.MOD	DESC:As targeted dispel magic, with additional targeted dispel magic the next turn.
Serpent's Tongue.MOD	DESC:Gain the scent ability, +5 bonus on saves against poison.
Soulreaving Aura.MOD	DESC:As reaving aura, plus gain temporary hit points if nearby creature dies.
Steal Summoning (Invocation).MOD	DESC:Take control of another caster's summoned monster.
Swimming the Styx.MOD	DESC:Gain swim speed and ability to breathe water.
Witchwood Step.MOD	DESC:Walk on water and move through some obstacles unimpeded.
